WEBVTT

00:00:01.808 --> 00:00:06.013
How to get a Claude API key
Needed only for "Write with AI". Copy and paste in a Claude chat works without one.

00:00:06.013 --> 00:00:10.221
1. Open the Claude Console
platform.claude.com. Sign in, or create an account with your e-mail address.

00:00:10.221 --> 00:00:14.626
2. Add credit
The API is paid for separately from a Claude chat plan. Add prepaid credit in the billing settings.

00:00:14.626 --> 00:00:19.035
3. Create a key
Settings, API keys, Create key. Name it, for example Job Agent.

00:00:19.035 --> 00:00:23.447
4. Copy it right away
The key starts with sk-ant- and is shown only once

00:00:23.447 --> 00:00:32.917
5. Paste it into Job Agent
Settings > AI and services

00:00:32.917 --> 00:00:36.317
Saved
It stays in your agent folder on this computer and is never shown again

00:00:36.317 --> 00:00:43.324
Keep the key private
Anyone with it can spend your credit. You can delete it in the Console at any time.
